OL,3,GNEWSACounty to get thousands of new EV
OL,4,Acharging points
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 5,500 electric vehicle charge
OL,7,Fpoints are set to be installed across
OL,8,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough.
OL,10,FThe Cambridgeshire and Peterborough
OL,11,FCombined Authority has secured #5.4m
OL,12,Ffrom the government's Local Electric
OL,13,FVehicle Infrastructure (LEVI) fund to
OL,14,Fprovide charging infrastructure for
OL,15,Fresidents without driveways or
OL,16,Foff-street parking.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
