OL,3,GNEWSACounty to get thousands of new EV
OL,4,Acharging points
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 1 October, Peterborough City
OL,7,FCouncil's cabinet agreed to accept
OL,8,F#1,075,770 of LEVI funding - and award
OL,9,Fa 15-year contract to the provider
OL,10,FBeliev to deliver 1,058 charge points
OL,11,Fin the city.
OL,13,FIn Cambridgeshire, 4,527 charge points
OL,14,Fwill be delivered from the rest of the
OL,15,FLEVI money, with the county council
OL,16,Fapproving the contract in December
OL,17,F2025.
